 2
Create a Function ADD_NUM() that accepts two NUMBER parameters
and returns the addition result.
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------

sql> CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION ADD_NUM
(
     A NUMBER,
     B NUMBER
)
RETURN NUMBER
IS
     C NUMBER;
BEGIN

     C:=A+B;

     RETURN C;

END;
/

Output:
-------

Function created.


Execute:
--------

sql> SELECT ADD_NUM(25,35) AS RESULT
     FROM DUAL;

Output:
-------

RESULT
------
60


